# Every text file is checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says. The hooks and
# manifests are read byte for byte: akm-hook.sh fails under sh with a CR on each line
# (a Windows clone with autocrlf=true), and tests/codex-plugin.test.ts compares the
# manifests to JSON.stringify output.
* text=auto eol=lf

# akm-cli's files, committed for Codex on release tags only (see "Commit and tag" in .github/workflows/release.yml):
# byte for byte, and out of diffs and language statistics.
claude/node_modules/** -text -diff linguist-vendored
